Source: rk3588-codec-udev
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Yi Ding <yi.s.ding@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rk3588-codec-udev
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, acl
Enhances: ffmpeg, gnome-remote-desktop
Description: unprivileged RK3588 video codec and RGA device access
 Installs a udev rule granting the video group and the active local seat
 read/write access to the Rockchip MPP codec device, RGA accelerator, and DMA
 heaps. DMA-heap access is required for RKMPP frame and stream allocation.
